  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health personnel IMNCI, BEmONC, NBC, iCCM capacity building training and monitoring, providing improved services in public health centers and public health centers, support for neonatal and postpartum care-oriented evacuation systems, medical equipment and medicine targeting health facilities, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
